no single one decides your keys.␀ADD RANDOMNESS␀␀RESTORE␀where are your seed words?␀␀keys from seed words you already have␀␀␀type each word, then tap it when it appears␀RUN AGAIN␀␀␀SPREAD SCORE␀␀␀␀nothing to audit␀␀␀␀what a fair chip looks like.␀␀␀␀FAIR RANGE␀␀a fair chip fails this 1 run in 500. run it again.␀␀tests the chip's random numbers␀random numbers␀␀made by the chip, not by software␀␀␀RANDOMNESS AUDIT␀␀␀␀TOO EVEN␀␀␀␀draws 5000 numbers␀␀THE TEST␀␀␀␀software would pass too␀THE LIMIT␀␀␀SCAN A QR␀␀␀the seed words file on this card is damaged or belongs to another device.

