nothing changed. your keys are fine.␀␀word #%d does not match␀your paper would not bring these keys back␀␀DOESN'T MATCH␀␀␀type your seed words to check them.␀VERIFY BACKUP␀␀␀Does your paper open these keys?␀␀␀␀CHECK YOUR BACKUP␀␀␀You type your seed words. The signer checks them against these keys.␀␀␀␀PROVES␀␀your paper opens them␀␀␀NEVER SHOWS␀keep it offline and private.
seed words + passphrase restore these keys.␀␀␀␀your coordinator shows the same one.␀␀␀␀every word matched␀␀the passphrase is not part of this check␀␀␀␀SEED WORDS VERIFIED␀Any BIP39 compatible signer or wallet opens them. Write them on paper.␀␀WRITE DOWN␀␀SEED WORDS + PASSPHRASE␀Seed words that rebuild your keys.␀␀12 or 24 ordered seed words␀which is word #%d?␀␀these add up␀␀␀␀seed words + this passphrase restore these keys␀WRITE THESE DOWN␀␀␀␀I WROTE THEM DOWN␀␀␀keep it offline and private.
